        "body": "# Bundle cables\nThree sensor cables enter the **Conduit** and travel on as one wide **Ribbon** into the collapsed group. The Conduit fans its lanes (its toolbar rotates or **Extends** the run); the trunk selects the whole ribbon. Or select several cables and right-click → **Insert Conduit**.",
