      "y": -1069,
      "init": {
        "label": "Standoffs",
        "body": "# Keep things apart\nThe pale bar under the cables links Sensor B to the Monitoring group: a **Standoff**. Drags, tidies, and group expansion keep the two between its min and max distance; the bar slants to show slack. Make one: select exactly two items → right-click → **Link with Standoff**.",
