      "init": {
        "label": "Live controls",
        "body": "# Switch + Expression\nName each slot on the **Input Switch** so it reads as a labeled choice, then pick which cable is live; cycle to flip scenarios without rewiring. Flip it to **Many** (see the switch below) and it collects the checked inputs into a **Cube** instead. The **Expression** node grew an input socket for every variable in its formula (`monthly` here); the formula opens a big typeset editor.",
